{
  "doc": "Invariant-only wall belts (H15), rendered from 09-tools/wall_guard.py BELT_INVARIANTS: each entry is a command prefix the wall guard also denies, so no belt is stricter than the guard. Paste-only for hosts with static lists and no hooks: Warp (denylist regexes), Zed (always_deny regexes), OpenCode (bash permission globs set to deny). Formats are from vendor docs, [UNVERIFIED] until installed.",
